{
  "name": "STR Guest Message Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this does\n\nA guest sends a message. The system works out which booking it belongs to, pulls\n**that property's guide and no other**, then either drafts a reply or hands the\nmessage to a person.\n\nSeven messages, three properties. Three get drafted, four go to a human.\n\nNothing here sends anything to a guest. Email is drafted for someone to approve.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1720,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## The isolation is a node, not a promise\n\n**Attach the Guide for That Property** is a Merge. Guest messages come in one\nside, property guides the other, and they are matched on `property_id`.\n\nThe guide for a property the guest has not booked is never attached, so the AI\nis never given it. There is nothing to refuse and nothing to talk around.\n\nThe naive build puts every property in one searchable pile and asks the AI\nnicely to use the right one. That is a **request**. This is a **join**.\n\nWatch MSG-2 and MSG-7 to see it hold.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1220,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Running it, and what is deliberately missing\n\nThe three source nodes and the reply writer have **pinned data**, so this runs\nwith no accounts connected. Unpin a node to make it call out for real; the AI\nnodes need an OpenAI credential.\n\n**Demo scope.** A production build adds a deterministic policy layer after the\nclassifier - so the model can ask for a human but can never authorise itself to\nskip one - plus a check that every fact in a reply really came from the attached\nguide. Both are worth building when a client is paying. Both would be noise on a\none-screen demo.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 470,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -740,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Run the Demo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1700,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://public.api.hospitable.com/v2/messages",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Get New Guest Messages (PMS)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1480,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://public.api.hospitable.com/v2/reservations",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Get the Bookings (PMS)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -1480,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_NOTION_DATABASE_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Property Guides (Notion)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -1480,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByFields",
        "fieldsToMatchString": "booking_ref",
        "joinMode": "enrichInput1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Match the Booking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -1240,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByFields",
        "fieldsToMatchString": "property_id",
        "joinMode": "enrichInput1",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Attach the Guide for That Property",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -1000,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -620,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputText": "=Property: {{ $json.name }}\nGuest: {{ $json.guest_name }}, booked {{ $json.check_in }} to {{ $json.check_out }}\n\nTHE PROPERTY GUIDE - THIS PROPERTY ONLY\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.facts, null, 2) }}\n\nTHE GUEST'S MESSAGE\n{{ $json.body }}",
        "categories": {
          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "Answer it",
              "description": "The property guide above contains the information needed to answer this message, and the message is a straightforward question about the stay - access, wifi, check-in or check-out times, house rules, appliances, parking, rubbish. Nothing about money, nothing upsetting, nothing urgent."
            },
            {
              "category": "A person handles it",
              "description": "Anything about money, refunds, cancellations or changing a booking; any complaint; anything that sounds like a safety problem such as gas, fire, flooding, or a guest who cannot get in; anything angry or distressed."
            },
            {
              "category": "Not in the guide",
              "description": "A reasonable question that the property guide above simply does not answer, or a question about a different property from the one in this booking. Do not guess - if the guide does not say it, this is the category."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallback": "other"
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Can We Answer This?",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textClassifier",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You write guest messages for Blue Cedar Stays, a short-term rental manager.\n\nAnswer the guest using ONLY the property guide below. You have not been given any other property's information. If something is not in the guide, do not invent it.\n\nPROPERTY: {{ $json.name }}\nGUEST: {{ $json.guest_name }}\nDATES: {{ $json.check_in }} to {{ $json.check_out }}\n\nTHE PROPERTY GUIDE - THIS PROPERTY ONLY\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.facts, null, 2) }}\n\nTHE GUEST'S MESSAGE\n{{ $json.body }}\n\nHOW TO WRITE IT\nWarm, short, plain. Use the guest's first name. Give the answer in the first line or two - guests are usually standing in a doorway holding a bag. Contractions are fine. No exclamation marks, no \"I hope this finds you well\", no marketing language.\n\nIf the answer is no, say so kindly and directly, and offer the next best thing if there is one.\n\nNever invent prices, times, codes, policies or facilities. Sign off with Blue Cedar Stays and nothing else. Return the message only.",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Write the Reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        -480,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "=Re: your stay at {{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.name }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {
          "sendTo": "={{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.guest_email }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Create the Draft (Human Approves)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#guest-escalations",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=*{{ $json.name }}* - {{ $json.guest_name }} ({{ $json.booking_ref }})\n> {{ $json.body }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Hand It to a Person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        -480,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Guest Messages",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "matchingColumns": [
            "Message"
          ],
          "value": {
            "Message": "={{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.message_id }}",
            "Property": "={{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.name }}",
            "Guest": "={{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.guest_name }}",
            "They Asked": "={{ $('Attach the Guide for That Property').item.json.body }}",
            "Outcome": "={{ $json.text ? 'Draft waiting for approval' : 'Sent to a person' }}",
            "Draft": "={{ $json.text || '' }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f6000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Log Every Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        0,
        260
      ]
    }
  ],
